  "question": {
    "text": "The plane containing the line <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> passes through the points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>b</mi></math> is equal to",
