  "solution": {
    "text": "If the plane contains the given line then it must pass through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and should be parallel to <math><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Also, the plane passes through the points&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.<br />Equation of the plane is<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> points&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfy the equation of the plane, if<br /><math><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
